Under_test_method.comment:
Get the non-normalized, decoded text of this element and its children, including only any newlines and spaces
present in the original source.
@return decoded, non-normalized text
@see #text()
@see #wholeOwnText()

Test_method.Method_body:
Document doc = Jsoup.parse("<p> Hello
there &nbsp;  </p>");
assertEquals(" Hello
there    ", doc.wholeText());
doc = Jsoup.parse("<p>Hello  
  there</p>");
assertEquals("Hello  
  there", doc.wholeText());
doc = Jsoup.parse("<p>Hello  <div>
  there</div></p>");
assertEquals("Hello  
  there", doc.wholeText());

Test_method.allMethod_info:
@Test
public void testWholeText() {
    Document doc = Jsoup.parse("<p> Hello\nthere &nbsp;  </p>");
    assertEquals(" Hello\nthere    ", doc.wholeText());
    doc = Jsoup.parse("<p>Hello  \n  there</p>");
    assertEquals("Hello  \n  there", doc.wholeText());
    doc = Jsoup.parse("<p>Hello  <div>\n  there</div></p>");
    assertEquals("Hello  \n  there", doc.wholeText());
}

